### Update event
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title":  "Updated Event",
    "description":  "Updated event description",
    "address":  "456 Elm St",
    "city":  "Los Angeles",
    "dateTime": "2026-10-09T18:48:18",
    "maxParticipants": 100,
    "minAge": 21,
    "maxAge": 100,
    "status": "COMPLETED",
    "creatorId": 1,
    "tagIds": [1, 2]
}


### Get all events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get events on the next pages
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?page=0&size=10&creatorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get event by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete coffee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

